OL,3,A'We had no idea how ill she was': Bono
OL,4,Aon recording Dolly Parton's last song
OL,5,
OL,6,FU2 are at their best when they act on
OL,7,Finstinct.
OL,9,FTheir biggest songs are fuelled by
OL,10,Ffiery indignation (Pride, Sunday Bloody
OL,11,FSunday) or sudden inspiration (One,
OL,12,FSometimes You Can't Make It On Your
OL,13,FOwn).
OL,15,FWhen they overthink, they misfire. An
OL,16,Fattempt to marry grunge and hip-hop on
OL,17,Fthe 2009 single Get On Your Boots was,
OL,18,Fin the words of drummer Larry Mullen
OL,19,FJr, "a catastrophic choice".
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
